    (a) `isWatcherBody` (gauntKind, or faction 'gaunt' for the strays) and a refusal
    at the top of `castRaise`, before `crime()` so a refused rite is not also a crime.
    The refusal deliberately leaves the corpse on the ground — asserted, because a
    refusal that eats the body is worse than the bug.
    (b) `isMachineBody` is `(redoubtId || golem) && construct`, exactly as this note
