    gives iron/ore/copper by frame size. THE HALF THAT IS EASY TO MISS: a machine must
    not feed `rememberRemains` either, or the refusal is undone in one step AND a
    walker's 20 tough quietly raises the remains quality that `bindCeiling` reads.
    Asserted separately.
    ALSO FIXED HERE: `golem` was never written to the save, so a Bone Golem lost its
    flag on reload and became raisable again. Added to sChar and restore.
    (c) The real cause was not the rig — `castRaise` handed `makeChar` stats and gear
    and NOTHING else, so `beast`, `kin`, `big`, `race`, `sub` and `sex` were dropped
    and re-rolled at random. `carryShape` carries them across. A mule's `kin` is
