    AND A CLAMP LEAK FOUND ON THE WAY: `makeChar` adds the line's flat bonuses to
    whatever it is handed, so the "never stronger dead than in life" ceilings passed
    in as arguments were then raised again by a subrace makeChar rolled at random
    (Ironscar-bred is +3 atk). The clamp now lands after the build.

